  <running_head>CANTICORVM.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Conspicaturæ caput,</l>
    <l n="2">Quale prodit gemmea-</l>
    <l n="3">Cum tiara, quam parens-</l>
    <l n="4">Ipsa filio dedit,</l>
    <l n="5">Quo die sponsalia-</l>
    <l n="6">Lætus iftæc orfus est.</l>
    <l n="7" type="heading" level="2" para="true">ODE IV.</l>
    <l n="8" type="heading" level="2">SPONSVS.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">1. Ecce tu pulcherrima,</l>
    <l n="10">Vnicè quàm diligo:</l>
    <l n="11">Ecce tu belliffima,</l>
    <l n="12">His columbæ prædita-</l>
    <l n="13">Pætulis ocellulis,</l>
    <l n="14">Hinc &amp; inde pendulis-</l>
    <l n="15">Crispulis cincinnulis.</l>
    <l n="16">Quale nos molliffimo-</l>
    <l n="17">Eminus pilo pecus-</l>
    <l n="18">Guiladiinis pascier-</l>
    <l n="19">Conspicamur saltibus,</l>
    <l n="20">Talis est tibi coma,</l>
    <l n="21">Molicella crispula.</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">2 At gemelles dentium-</l>
    <l n="23">Ordines eburneos,</l>
    <l n="24">Ordines iunctiffimos-</l>
    <l n="25">Compararim candido-</l>
    <l n="26">Cum bidentum vellere,</l>
    <l n="27">Quæ nitentes vitreo-</l>
    <l n="28">E lauacro prodeunt,</l>
    <l n="29">Cum gemellis singul-</l>
    <l n="30">æHinc &amp; inde fœtibus:</l>
    <l n="31">Nulla vt isto de grege-</l>
    <l n="32">Possit orba conspici.</l>
    <l n="33" para="true">Tale quiddam crispulæ-</l>
    <l n="34">Inter emicat comæ-</l>
    <l n="35">Tortiles cincinnulos.</l>
    <l n="36" para="true">4. Quale furgit Dauidis-</l>
    <l n="37">Forte propugnaculum,</l>
    <l n="38">Hinc &amp; hinc pendentibus-</l>
    <l n="39">Mille scutis principum-</l>
    <l n="40">Atque peltis nobile:</l>
    <l n="41">Talepræceri micat</l>
    <l n="42">Hoc tui colli decus,</l>
    <l n="43">Hinc &amp; inde gemmeis-</l>
    <l n="44">Mille cinċti torquibus.</l>
    <l n="45" para="true">5. Destinata denique-</l>
    <l n="46">Educandis hæc tuis-</l>
    <l n="47">Bina spectans vbera,</l>
    <l n="48">Capreæ te comparo-</l>
    <l n="49">Quæ gemellos hinnulos,</l>
    <l n="50">Comptulos, politulos,</l>
    <l n="51">Pascit inter lilia.</l>
    <l n="52" para="true">6. Cæterùm donec dies,</l>
    <l n="53">Noctis abscedentibus-</l>
    <l n="54">Prorsus vmbris fulgeat,</l>
    <l n="55">Montem adibo myrrheum,</l>
    <l n="56">Collem adibo thureum.</l>
    <l n="57" para="true">7. Tota tu pulcherrima,</l>
    <l n="58">Tu mihi charissima,</l>
    <l n="59">Labis omnis nescia.</l>
    <l n="60" para="true">8. Tu tuo me tempore,</l>
    <l n="61">Sponsa, adibis, Libani,</l>
    <l n="62">Libani è cacumine:</l>
    <l n="63">Tu me Amani à vertice,</l>
    <l n="64">Me Scheniris ex iugo,</l>
    <l n="65">Hermonisque culmine,</l>
    <l n="66">Ex leonum rupibus,</l>
    <l n="67">Læta conspicabere.</l>
    <l n="68" para="true">9. Tu mihi memet soror,</l>
